   "design": "Slide updates start from a draft based on the outline and textbook, checked line by line. Comments come from the scientist's own comment bank and are edited. Grades flow from the learning platform into the student system, so they are not entered twice. A course forum lets one answer reach every student, and materials publish on the lecture date. Problems, lectures, practicals, grading and office hours stay with the scientist; no model scores student work.",
